      The calculators and written content are free to use for personal, educational and commercial
      purposes. No account is required. You may link to any page freely.
    </p>
    <p>You agree not to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload or interfere with the site or its hosting.</li>
      <li>Republish substantial portions of the written content as your own.</li>
      <li>Use automated systems in a way that degrades the service for other people.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>
      The site is provided “as is” and “as available”, without warranties of any kind, whether
      express or implied. While the calculation logic is covered by an automated test suite and
      considerable care goes into accuracy, no guarantee is given that every result is correct,
      suitable for your purpose, or that the site will be uninterrupted or error-free.
    </p>

