      from use of this site or reliance on its results, including any direct, indirect, incidental or
      consequential loss. Nothing in these terms excludes liability that cannot lawfully be excluded.
    </p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      The written content, design and source code of this site belong to its operator. Mathematical
      formulas themselves are not owned by anyone, and you are welcome to use the results of any
      calculation however you wish.
    </p>

    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>
      Any links to other websites are provided for convenience. Their content is not controlled here
      and no responsibility is taken for it.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      These terms may be updated from time to time, and the “last updated” date above will reflect
      any change. Continuing to use the site after a change means you accept the revised terms.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</ContentLayout>
